    {
      "id": "claim_6060fa53d402492ba3e4d6a714ac0c53",
      "statement": "The repository contains no automated tests for the persistence layer (server/tests is empty, as AGENTS.md states), so schema and delete-semantics changes must be validated by starting the server and inspecting the database and filesystem.",
